      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783676467775,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Auth:\n\n- `POST /signup`\n- `POST /signin`\n\nTrading and account:\n\n- `POST /onramp`\n- `POST /market`\n- `POST /order`\n- `DELETE /order/:id`\n- `GET /orders`\n- `GET /fills`\n- `GET /balance`\n\nPublic market data:\n\n- `GET /markets`\n- `GET /depth/:symbol`\n- `GET /klines/:symbol?interval=1m|5m|15m|1h|4h|1d&from=&to=&limit=`\n- `GET /ticker/:symbol`\n- `GET /trades/:symbol?limit=`",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Auth:\n\n- `POST /signup`\n- `POST /signin`\n\nTrading and account:\n\n- `POST /onramp`\n- `POST /market`\n- `POST /order`\n- `DELETE /order/:id`\n- `GET /orders`\n- `GET /fills`\n- `GET /balance`\n\nPublic market data:\n\n- `GET /markets`\n- `GET /depth/:symbol`\n- `GET /klines/:symbol?interval=1m|5m|15m|1h|4h|1d&from=&to=&limit=`\n- `GET /ticker/:symbol`\n- `GET /trades/:symbol?limit=`",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
